msgid "ADR 0019：sidecar 子树生命周期"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0019-sidecar-subtree-lifetime.md:4
#: d9df096b74d94733844724fcfd1e3d91
msgid "**状态**：已接受 **日期**：2026-08-25 **关联**：ADR 0014（UI 迁移到 Tauri）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0019-sidecar-subtree-lifetime.md:8
#: 10f1c9040b3b46e2915d9a3a378e97aa
msgid ""
"关闭应用后，sidecar 进程（e2m2e）留在后台继续运行——包括正在计算的轨道族任务。我们决定在 Windows 上把 sidecar "
"子树划入 kill-on-close 的 Job Object，由内核保证其随应用进程死亡而终结。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0019-sidecar-subtree-lifetime.md:10
#: 76acefa0ef4e4570a2d2f091b08d0e8b
msgid "背景与根因"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0019-sidecar-subtree-lifetime.md:12
#: b837bdee4d3149f79c57939a8dcc98fb
msgid ""
"sidecar 的 stdin EOF 只在空闲读循环时生效：e2m2e `run_loop` 逐行读请求，深陷计算（轨道族延拓可达分钟级）时不读"
" stdin，感知不到 EOF。而现有杀进程手段全都够不到真正干活的进程："
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0019-sidecar-subtree-lifetime.md:14
#: 054c7d937c484693b54ebe2a68270564
msgid ""
"`TerminateProcess` / `kill_on_drop` 只杀直接子进程。dev 期命令是 `uv run e2m2e serve-"
"stdio`（uv.exe → python.exe），分发期 sidecar 是 PyInstaller onefile（bootloader "
"运行时再拉一个子进程）——两种形态下 python 都是孙进程；"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0019-sidecar-subtree-lifetime.md:15
#: a0e156fbf58842b6bf33f2d22e31a179
msgid "显式 `shutdown()` 无调用时机能覆盖崩溃、被杀、updater `std::process::exit` 等退出路径。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0019-sidecar-subtree-lifetime.md:17
#: ed8ca464d08449acb675219a8151b9cd
msgid "Considered Options"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0019-sidecar-subtree-lifetime.md:19
#: 0dea4211430543d7b20e94da794a8646
msgid ""
"**Windows Job Object（kill-on-close）**：spawn 后立刻把直接子进程划入新建 job；job "
"成员资格在进程创建时继承，孙进程自动入内。应用无论怎么退出（关窗口、崩溃、被杀、updater 重启），OS 关闭 job "
"句柄即由内核终结整棵树，不依赖任何用户态清理代码运行。只圈 sidecar 子树、不圈应用自身，updater 拉起的安装器等外部进程不受影响。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0019-sidecar-subtree-lifetime.md:20
#: 843fc8d1581741d2a7a733c5c46e6e78
msgid ""
"**退出事件里显式 shutdown + 树杀（taskkill /T "
"或手工枚举）**：只覆盖优雅退出路径，崩溃与被杀路径仍残留；进程树枚举代码量更大且需维护。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0019-sidecar-subtree-lifetime.md:21
#: 7d709207fba841e3af7fb892067c0381
msgid "**依赖 stdin EOF（维持现状）**：仅空闲态有效，忙碌态残留分钟级；用户在计算中途关窗即复现。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0019-sidecar-subtree-lifetime.md:23
#: a27863bda21f46e9ba3b08ee460517e4
msgid "Consequences"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0019-sidecar-subtree-lifetime.md:25
#: 5d2d95fb13604d83ba16e4e773334e06
msgid ""
"`SidecarHandle`（`src-tauri/src/sidecar/process.rs`）持有 job "
"句柄，句柄链随应用状态销毁或进程死亡关闭，内核即终结子树。回归测试 "
"`busy_grandchild_tree_killed_when_handle_dropped` 固化了\"drop 句柄 → "
"忙碌孙进程树被终结\"。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0019-sidecar-subtree-lifetime.md:26
#: 1eabfc4548f24ecc9609c588e7d67090
msgid "竞态窗口可忽略：assign 在 spawn 返回后微秒级执行，解释器（uv / bootloader）启动到拉孙进程是毫秒级以上。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0019-sidecar-subtree-lifetime.md:27
#: a683135c82c742218a9e5696d39c5997
msgid "job 创建或划入失败时降级为无兜底（警告日志），不阻断应用启动。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0019-sidecar-subtree-lifetime.md:28
#: 44bb82d1259b4eedac4bb0d85cad73ad
msgid ""
"Unix 无 Job Object 等价物：空闲态由 EOF 覆盖，忙碌态会跑完当前计算后经 EOF 退出，不产生永久残留；如未来 Linux "
"用户报告计算中关窗残留，再引入进程组（`setsid` + `killpg`）方案。"
msgstr ""

